{
  "why": "0.4.0 is HAL-less and V1-only on fm-server 4.6's model routes. Each case is one client call and the requests it must send, in order. All three SDKs run every case against a loopback server; a request the case does not list -- the API root above all -- fails it.",
  "server": "4.6.2",
